1
00:01:35,759 --> 00:01:39,810
[Abyss]

2
00:01:40,870 --> 00:01:44,840
[2004]

3
00:02:41,079 --> 00:02:41,810
Dehua,

4
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,240
you're crying?

5
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,600
It's so late. What are you doing here?

6
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:52,130
I noticed you've been acting
a bit off lately.

7
00:02:53,210 --> 00:02:54,000
Dehua,

8
00:02:54,850 --> 00:02:56,180
did you get dumped?

9
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,610
Something happened to her.

10
00:03:01,900 --> 00:03:03,100
Something happened?

11
00:03:04,180 --> 00:03:05,250
What happened?

12
00:03:05,460 --> 00:03:06,190
Li Cheng!

13
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:08,900
Mom.

14
00:03:09,050 --> 00:03:09,820
Go home.

15
00:03:10,300 --> 00:03:11,790
It's the middle of the night.

16
00:03:11,790 --> 00:03:13,400
Leave Dehua in peace.

17
00:03:13,430 --> 00:03:14,240
Got it.

18
00:03:14,750 --> 00:03:15,410
Hurry up.

19
00:03:16,930 --> 00:03:18,460
Dehua, I'll head back now.

20
00:03:18,490 --> 00:03:20,150
I'll come see you another day.

21
00:03:27,500 --> 00:03:28,800
Look at you.

22
00:03:28,910 --> 00:03:30,090
Your exams are coming up,

23
00:03:30,090 --> 00:03:31,930
and you're still fooling around all day.

24
00:03:31,930 --> 00:03:33,150
You mess around during the day

25
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:34,710
and don't come home at night.

26
00:03:34,710 --> 00:03:35,680
I just wanted Dehua

27
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:36,520
-to tutor me.
-Save it.

28
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:37,720
Stop making excuses.

29
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:41,890
♪ All things will fade into night ♪

30
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:48,930
♪ Your mind will break, then take flight ♪

31
00:03:54,790 --> 00:03:59,220
[Episode 16]

32
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:03,330
[Ping'an Province, Xihai City,
Huangshui Public Security Bureau]

33
00:04:02,780 --> 00:04:04,820
Bank investigation records show that

34
00:04:04,820 --> 00:04:06,950
on May 3rd, 2004,

35
00:04:04,880 --> 00:04:06,250
[Case Report]

36
00:04:07,130 --> 00:04:08,630
Futong Trading

37
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:09,320
[Debit]
[Recipient: Chen Chunli]

38
00:04:08,630 --> 00:04:11,060
transferred 300,000 to Liu Cui's account.

39
00:04:11,250 --> 00:04:13,090
On the day she received the money,

40
00:04:13,090 --> 00:04:15,780
Liu Cui immediately transferred
the full amount to Chen Chunli's account.

41
00:04:15,780 --> 00:04:16,800
We asked our colleagues in the ECID

42
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:18,600
to look into this company,

43
00:04:19,010 --> 00:04:20,660
and found its actual controller

44
00:04:20,140 --> 00:04:21,570
[Name: Hu Songhua]

45
00:04:20,660 --> 00:04:23,160
is Hu Xiaofei's father, Hu Songhua.

46
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:23,330
[Relationship: Hu Songhua and Hu Xiaofei
are father and son]

47
00:04:23,570 --> 00:04:25,310
Before going to prison,

48
00:04:25,310 --> 00:04:26,480
Hu Songhua had his son, Hu Xiaofei,

49
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:28,070
hold his shares on his behalf.

50
00:04:28,070 --> 00:04:29,430
Who is Chen Wanji?

51
00:04:29,540 --> 00:04:30,920
Chen Chunli's cousin.

52
00:04:30,940 --> 00:04:32,830
When Chen Chunli's case happened,

53
00:04:32,830 --> 00:04:33,720
we asked her about

54
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:35,600
the whereabouts of her son, Guo Pengfei.

55
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:36,180
She said

56
00:04:36,180 --> 00:04:39,010
she planned to marry her boyfriend,
Chen Dingkun,

57
00:04:39,190 --> 00:04:40,909
but Guo Pengfei strongly opposed it

58
00:04:40,909 --> 00:04:43,690
and frequently clashed with them.

59
00:04:43,770 --> 00:04:45,330
To prevent him from repeating a year

60
00:04:45,330 --> 00:04:46,600
and help him get into college sooner,

61
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:48,620
she sent him to live and study
at her cousin

62
00:04:48,620 --> 00:04:50,120
Chen Wanji's house.

63
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:52,940
So Guo Pengfei transferred
to a school in Xidu.

64
00:04:52,970 --> 00:04:55,490
How was your relationship
with Chen Chunli?

65
00:04:59,010 --> 00:05:00,130
My sister

66
00:05:00,310 --> 00:05:01,580
had a hard life.

67
00:05:02,250 --> 00:05:03,600
She had a child early,

68
00:05:03,620 --> 00:05:04,680
struggled to make a living,

69
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,970
and worked odd jobs everywhere.

70
00:05:05,970 --> 00:05:07,700
I left home early,

71
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:09,860
so we didn't have much contact back then.

72
00:05:09,860 --> 00:05:10,720
It wasn't until

73
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:12,930
she sent Pengfei to study here

74
00:05:12,950 --> 00:05:14,810
that we started keeping in touch.

75
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:18,040
We only talked on the phone to check in

76
00:05:18,070 --> 00:05:19,920
with each other
when she transferred money to me

77
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,250
or around the holidays.

78
00:05:21,250 --> 00:05:22,240
In a year,

79
00:05:22,260 --> 00:05:23,830
she'd transfer me

80
00:05:23,890 --> 00:05:25,440
about 20,000 in total.

81
00:05:25,460 --> 00:05:27,440
You see, I don't have

82
00:05:27,620 --> 00:05:30,010
many expenses here.

83
00:05:30,010 --> 00:05:31,760
Except for the kid's living expenses,

84
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:33,950
I saved the rest for him.

85
00:05:33,980 --> 00:05:36,440
So when he got married and bought a house,

86
00:05:36,460 --> 00:05:38,100
I gave it all back to him.

87
00:05:39,420 --> 00:05:41,600
Guo Pengfei must be very close to you.

88
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:43,030
Absolutely.

89
00:05:43,050 --> 00:05:44,680
He's like my own.

90
00:05:44,710 --> 00:05:45,670
How was Guo Pengfei's

91
00:05:45,670 --> 00:05:47,470
relationship with Chen Chunli?

92
00:05:48,150 --> 00:05:50,000
We checked their call logs.

93
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:50,950
Over the past 8 years,

94
00:05:50,950 --> 00:05:52,890
Chen Chunli only called
Guo Pengfei once a year

95
00:05:52,890 --> 00:05:54,570
during the Spring Festival.

96
00:05:54,590 --> 00:05:55,650
Other than that,

97
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:56,860
they had no contact.

98
00:05:56,860 --> 00:05:58,330
What about Han Pinmu and Hu Xiaofei?

99
00:05:58,330 --> 00:05:59,310
None at all.

100
00:05:59,370 --> 00:06:00,830
We looked into it back then.

101
00:06:00,830 --> 00:06:01,890
From 2000 to 2001,

102
00:06:02,060 --> 00:06:03,720
the three of them were in the same school

103
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:05,740
but different classes.

104
00:06:06,130 --> 00:06:07,360
We don't know how close they were,

105
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,920
but they definitely knew each other.

106
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:11,040
But if they were close—

107
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:13,810
plus Chen Chunli
was a victim of the 3/12 Case—

108
00:06:14,100 --> 00:06:15,920
Hu Xiaofei must know the identities

109
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,930
of Zhang Chengguo and Song Laifu.

110
00:06:17,950 --> 00:06:19,330
Would he have done nothing?

111
00:06:19,330 --> 00:06:20,450
He did do something.

112
00:06:20,450 --> 00:06:21,570
He transferred 300,000.

113
00:06:21,570 --> 00:06:22,770
What was the purpose?

114
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:23,800
To protect himself?

115
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:24,860
He couldn't report the real killer,

116
00:06:24,860 --> 00:06:26,870
so he gave her a large sum of money
as an apology?

117
00:06:26,870 --> 00:06:28,130
If so,

118
00:06:28,830 --> 00:06:30,430
would Chen Chunli accept it?

119
00:06:36,670 --> 00:06:38,140
Li Cheng had

120
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:39,690
a theory before.

121
00:06:39,710 --> 00:06:41,680
I thought it was too bold at the time.

122
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:42,850
Now it seems

123
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,270
highly possible.

124
00:06:44,310 --> 00:06:45,440
Go ahead and tell us.

125
00:06:49,010 --> 00:06:49,920
The Chen Chunli case was designed

126
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:52,600
to cover up the flaws in the Du Juan case.

127
00:06:52,620 --> 00:06:54,570
The goal was to redirect
the police's attention

128
00:06:54,570 --> 00:06:56,950
back to the first three cases.

129
00:06:56,980 --> 00:06:58,130
Throughout the whole process,

130
00:06:58,130 --> 00:06:59,540
not only Han Pinmu

131
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:00,750
but also Chen Chunli

132
00:07:00,750 --> 00:07:03,180
was protecting a hidden third person.

133
00:07:03,550 --> 00:07:05,150
The only person

134
00:07:05,330 --> 00:07:06,500
who could make a mother

135
00:07:06,500 --> 00:07:07,920
risk everything to cover up the truth

136
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:09,370
is her son—

137
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:10,560
Guo Pengfei.

138
00:07:15,070 --> 00:07:16,720
In that case,

139
00:07:16,750 --> 00:07:17,920
Guo Pengfei is highly likely

140
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,570
to be the suspect in the Du Juan case.

141
00:07:19,570 --> 00:07:20,780
That explains

142
00:07:20,810 --> 00:07:23,100
why Chen Chunli attacked Han Pinmu.

143
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:25,130
The police reopened the 3/12 Case,

144
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:26,970
which made Chen Chunli uneasy.

145
00:07:26,990 --> 00:07:28,160
She hated Han Pinmu

146
00:07:28,190 --> 00:07:30,690
for dragging Guo Pengfei into this.

147
00:07:30,710 --> 00:07:32,140
It also explains

148
00:07:32,170 --> 00:07:33,990
why Han Pinmu,
despite being severely injured,

149
00:07:33,990 --> 00:07:35,920
cleaned up the scene for Chen Chunli

150
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:37,480
after she fled.

151
00:07:37,510 --> 00:07:39,300
Then the Chen Chunli case

152
00:07:39,860 --> 00:07:41,600
was very likely

153
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:43,330
a self-directed ruse.

154
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:47,700
I can't believe she could be
so cruel to herself.

155
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:53,190
Hello?

156
00:07:56,050 --> 00:07:57,850
Okay, I'll be right there.

157
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:00,470
Sun Qiang is awake.

158
00:08:02,180 --> 00:08:04,620
I kowtowed to the King of Hell,

159
00:08:05,450 --> 00:08:07,180
and they actually sent me back.

160
00:08:08,890 --> 00:08:11,830
Or maybe they didn't take me

161
00:08:12,330 --> 00:08:13,420
because I hadn't confessed
everything I did.

162
00:08:13,420 --> 00:08:15,150
Are you feeling okay now?

163
00:08:15,770 --> 00:08:17,420
We can come back when you're well rested.

164
00:08:17,420 --> 00:08:18,920
No need. I'm fine.

165
00:08:20,370 --> 00:08:22,000
You've waited long enough.

166
00:08:23,810 --> 00:08:25,310
Is Zhang Chengguo caught?

167
00:08:26,940 --> 00:08:27,880
He's dead.

168
00:08:28,890 --> 00:08:31,270
He died near where you passed out.

169
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:32,919
Serves him right.

170
00:08:33,980 --> 00:08:35,530
Justice is served.

171
00:08:36,299 --> 00:08:37,760
Who else was there that day

172
00:08:37,909 --> 00:08:38,890
besides you?

173
00:08:38,890 --> 00:08:40,150
I don't know.

174
00:08:41,169 --> 00:08:42,600
I lost consciousness

175
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:43,820
after Zhang Chengguo stabbed me.

176
00:08:43,820 --> 00:08:45,120
Why did he stab you?

177
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:50,580
He offered me 100,000

178
00:08:51,010 --> 00:08:52,670
to kill you at Happiness Park.

179
00:08:54,370 --> 00:08:56,120
I got the wrong guy

180
00:08:56,460 --> 00:08:58,340
and killed an old cop.

181
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:00,670
He didn't want to pay the rest,

182
00:09:00,940 --> 00:09:02,790
and he was afraid I'd talk,

183
00:09:02,910 --> 00:09:05,370
so he lured me to the reservoir
to silence me.

184
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:07,620
You'd kill someone for 100,000?

185
00:09:07,620 --> 00:09:08,720
100,000.

186
00:09:09,510 --> 00:09:12,320
Cheng, I'm not as lucky as you.

187
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,600
My family could only provide
food and drinks,

188
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:15,960
nothing else.

189
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,360
It'd take me

190
00:09:17,380 --> 00:09:19,050
half a lifetime to save up 100,000.

191
00:09:19,050 --> 00:09:20,510
How could I not be tempted?

192
00:09:20,650 --> 00:09:22,460
How did Han Pinmu know

193
00:09:22,510 --> 00:09:24,370
Zhang Chengguo wanted to kill me?

194
00:09:24,580 --> 00:09:25,890
I was too greedy.

195
00:09:26,410 --> 00:09:27,370
At first,

196
00:09:27,370 --> 00:09:28,390
Zhang Chengguo saw me

197
00:09:28,390 --> 00:09:30,200
playing games at Han's place,

198
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,750
so he offered me money

199
00:09:31,790 --> 00:09:33,920
to get information out of Han Pinmu.

200
00:09:33,940 --> 00:09:35,660
But Han isn't stupid.

201
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,590
He paid me more

202
00:09:37,900 --> 00:09:40,060
to get information on Zhang Chengguo.

203
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,840
So I told him

204
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:45,260
that Zhang Chengguo was looking
for someone to ambush you.

205
00:09:45,410 --> 00:09:47,000
But I didn't say it was me.

206
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,700
Did Han Pinmu also know

207
00:09:48,890 --> 00:09:50,220
you went to the fish pond?

208
00:09:50,220 --> 00:09:51,010
Yes.

209
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,410
He even warned me

210
00:09:54,500 --> 00:09:56,340
it would be dangerous to go.

211
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,480
Did he go?

212
00:09:58,320 --> 00:09:59,650
I don't know about that.

213
00:09:59,790 --> 00:10:01,050
I didn't see him.

214
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:04,630
Do you know why Zhang Chengguo

215
00:10:04,740 --> 00:10:06,080
and Han Pinmu were against each other?

216
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,060
No idea.

217
00:10:09,950 --> 00:10:11,150
But I think

218
00:10:11,370 --> 00:10:13,500
it was not just the two of them.

219
00:10:14,010 --> 00:10:15,780
S-Song Laifu.

220
00:10:15,980 --> 00:10:17,440
And Feiyang.

221
00:10:17,470 --> 00:10:19,600
They all seemed to be mixed up in it too.

222
00:10:21,140 --> 00:10:23,190
How much do you know

223
00:10:23,380 --> 00:10:24,950
about Song Laifu and Feiyang?

224
00:10:24,950 --> 00:10:26,680
Song is definitely something.

225
00:10:27,420 --> 00:10:29,700
I feel like even Zhang Chengguo
was afraid of him.

226
00:10:29,700 --> 00:10:30,530
I heard

227
00:10:30,530 --> 00:10:33,140
they met while working
in the provincial capital,

228
00:10:33,140 --> 00:10:36,070
then they came to Huangshui together
to do business.

229
00:10:36,530 --> 00:10:39,510
Later, Zhang Chengguo
got in with Li Zhengbin, I think.

230
00:10:39,510 --> 00:10:43,720
And Song Laifu went to Xidu...

231
00:10:44,210 --> 00:10:45,090
to work.

232
00:10:45,460 --> 00:10:47,130
Then Zhang Chengguo went
to a friend's construction site,

233
00:10:47,130 --> 00:10:48,550
saw Song Laifu there,

234
00:10:48,550 --> 00:10:50,810
and brought him back to work at the hotel.

235
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,600
I remember I told you, right?

236
00:10:53,220 --> 00:10:55,000
Han came to the hotel

237
00:10:55,130 --> 00:10:56,910
and had a fight with Song Laifu.

238
00:10:57,410 --> 00:10:58,980
But I don't know why.

239
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:01,750
As for Feiyang...

240
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:04,660
He's Han Pinmu's bro, I think.

241
00:11:06,390 --> 00:11:07,220
I've never seen

242
00:11:07,220 --> 00:11:09,510
Han favor anyone so much.

243
00:11:10,220 --> 00:11:11,940
But why exactly,

244
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:14,120
and what's the deal with Feiyang...

245
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:15,590
I don't know.

246
00:11:16,650 --> 00:11:19,290
You managed to wake up in this condition.

247
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,290
You're

248
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:22,840
pretty lucky.

249
00:11:24,170 --> 00:11:25,290
Rest up

250
00:11:25,310 --> 00:11:26,860
and wait for the summons.

251
00:11:26,880 --> 00:11:28,310
Officer.

252
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:33,580
I'm turning myself in, right?

253
00:11:34,650 --> 00:11:36,290
Can I make a request?

254
00:11:36,460 --> 00:11:37,150
Go ahead.

255
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:39,200
Please don't tell my mom.

256
00:11:40,740 --> 00:11:41,650
My mom...

257
00:11:42,830 --> 00:11:43,470
I...

258
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:46,600
I don't want her to know

259
00:11:46,940 --> 00:11:48,800
that she gave birth to a murderer.

260
00:11:49,630 --> 00:11:51,360
We will follow the procedures.

261
00:11:51,400 --> 00:11:52,710
Thank you. Thank you.

262
00:11:56,390 --> 00:11:57,600
L-Li Cheng!

263
00:11:58,320 --> 00:11:59,740
There's something about Feiyang

264
00:11:59,740 --> 00:12:01,340
I've been keeping to myself.

265
00:12:01,690 --> 00:12:03,520
Maybe it's just my wild guess.

266
00:12:03,630 --> 00:12:04,550
What is it?

267
00:12:04,790 --> 00:12:06,990
I suspect Feiyang is actually 2 people.

268
00:12:08,630 --> 00:12:10,890
I'm one of the veterans on our team.

269
00:12:11,100 --> 00:12:12,650
I joined

270
00:12:12,650 --> 00:12:14,380
back in the Snake Venom 3C days.

271
00:12:14,770 --> 00:12:16,910
I found it weird even back then.

272
00:12:17,940 --> 00:12:19,890
Feiyang's playstyle

273
00:12:19,890 --> 00:12:21,050
and position

274
00:12:21,820 --> 00:12:24,050
would sometimes be completely different.

275
00:12:24,050 --> 00:12:25,510
It was like a different person
was playing.

276
00:12:25,510 --> 00:12:28,880
Until the first half of last year,

277
00:12:29,410 --> 00:12:32,370
one of them seemed to stop playing.

278
00:12:32,670 --> 00:12:34,530
The playstyle stopped changing.

279
00:12:34,750 --> 00:12:37,670
The remaining one is the Feiyang we know.

280
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:39,100
I don't know

281
00:12:39,100 --> 00:12:40,640
if this helps you at all.

282
00:12:40,870 --> 00:12:43,600
Maybe it was just two brothers
sharing an account

283
00:12:43,830 --> 00:12:45,500
to save money on skins.

284
00:12:50,810 --> 00:12:52,000
Hey, Sen.

285
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:54,120
Have the Cyber Security Team check

286
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,100
the login IP addresses

287
00:12:55,100 --> 00:12:56,510
for Feiyang's game account,

288
00:12:56,510 --> 00:12:58,510
especially the ones before last year.

289
00:12:58,510 --> 00:12:59,160
Yes.

290
00:12:59,370 --> 00:13:01,500
Let me know as soon as you have any news.

291
00:13:01,500 --> 00:13:02,340
Thanks.

292
00:13:03,890 --> 00:13:05,370
[Emergency]

293
00:13:05,470 --> 00:13:10,540
[Huangshui Centre Hospital]

294
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:23,140
[Incoming call: Hu Sen]

295
00:13:23,820 --> 00:13:24,550
Mr. Li.

296
00:13:26,860 --> 00:13:28,370
Hey, Li Cheng. We found it.

297
00:13:28,370 --> 00:13:29,860
Besides his local IP addresses,
Feiyang has

298
00:13:29,860 --> 00:13:30,600
another frequently used IP address.

299
00:13:30,600 --> 00:13:31,910
It's in Xidu,

300
00:13:31,910 --> 00:13:33,390
at an Internet cafe

301
00:13:33,390 --> 00:13:35,120
near Guo Pengfei's workplace.

302
00:13:38,900 --> 00:13:40,670
Then Mr. Li and I
will head straight to Xidu.

303
00:13:40,670 --> 00:13:41,860
You guys sort out the paperwork

304
00:13:41,860 --> 00:13:42,860
and send it over.

305
00:13:42,890 --> 00:13:44,200
Okay. Stay safe.

306
00:13:46,900 --> 00:13:50,620
[Qidu City]

307
00:13:50,660 --> 00:13:52,150
[Public Security]

308
00:13:56,100 --> 00:13:56,770
Let's go.

309
00:14:00,130 --> 00:14:00,820
This way, please.

310
00:14:00,770 --> 00:14:02,100
[Technical Support & Training
Industrial Internet Industry]

311
00:14:14,730 --> 00:14:15,750
Guo Pengfei.

312
00:14:17,970 --> 00:14:19,430
[Police] [Li Cheng]

313
00:14:19,530 --> 00:14:22,810
[Summons of
the Huangshui Public Security Bureau]

314
00:14:36,810 --> 00:14:38,160
She's the best

315
00:14:38,190 --> 00:14:40,520
at playing the great woman I've ever seen.

316
00:14:40,810 --> 00:14:42,130
Her man ran away,

317
00:14:43,010 --> 00:14:44,990
and she gave birth to me all by herself.

318
00:14:44,990 --> 00:14:46,730
She moved around doing odd jobs

319
00:14:45,090 --> 00:14:48,920
[Filming]

320
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:48,810
to put food on the table.

321
00:14:49,650 --> 00:14:50,830
When she worked as a waitress,

322
00:14:50,830 --> 00:14:52,590
-I stayed in the kitchen.
-It's hot. Be careful.

323
00:14:52,590 --> 00:14:53,290
Here's your food.

324
00:14:53,290 --> 00:14:54,750
Braised pork with winter melon,
and greens.

325
00:14:54,750 --> 00:14:56,420
Great cooking skills.

326
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:57,250
Coming!

327
00:14:57,250 --> 00:14:58,720
Don't get in Mom's way.

328
00:15:00,530 --> 00:15:01,620
You play so well.

329
00:15:01,620 --> 00:15:03,050
When she worked as a nanny,

330
00:15:03,050 --> 00:15:05,390
I would read
in the employer's storage room.

331
00:15:05,390 --> 00:15:07,470
When she sold vegetables
in the freezing cold,

332
00:15:07,470 --> 00:15:09,670
I would do my homework next to the stall.

333
00:15:10,150 --> 00:15:12,590
My hands got frostbitten
more times than I can count.

334
00:15:12,590 --> 00:15:14,520
People always say she had it rough.

335
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:16,580
But everything she went through,

336
00:15:16,820 --> 00:15:18,510
I went through with her.

337
00:15:19,070 --> 00:15:20,830
But I was just a child back then.

338
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:25,000
I was a fatherless bastard
in other people's eyes.

339
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:26,270
What are you doing?

340
00:15:26,400 --> 00:15:28,000
Go back and do your homework!

341
00:15:29,710 --> 00:15:30,550
I hate her

342
00:15:31,330 --> 00:15:32,910
for giving birth to me.

343
00:15:33,040 --> 00:15:35,570
Later, she got a boyfriend.

344
00:15:35,860 --> 00:15:37,510
He was a teacher at No. 3 High School.

345
00:15:37,510 --> 00:15:38,470
To be honest,

346
00:15:38,990 --> 00:15:40,060
he was a nice guy.

347
00:15:40,750 --> 00:15:41,960
But I felt

348
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:44,080
his presence

349
00:15:44,650 --> 00:15:46,250
made me even more redundant.

350
00:15:52,770 --> 00:15:53,690
Pengfei will be back soon.

351
00:15:53,690 --> 00:15:54,880
I have to go.

352
00:15:55,620 --> 00:15:56,670
Don't let the kid see me.

353
00:15:56,670 --> 00:15:57,800
He'll get mad again.

354
00:15:58,390 --> 00:16:01,580
I hope he can make me proud this year,

355
00:16:01,670 --> 00:16:03,380
get into college,

356
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:05,620
and lighten my burden.

357
00:16:06,460 --> 00:16:09,390
Then we won't have to sneak
around like this anymore.

358
00:16:10,170 --> 00:16:11,050
Alright.

359
00:16:11,500 --> 00:16:13,700
Pengfei is a sensible kid.

360
00:16:14,170 --> 00:16:15,370
He's working hard.

361
00:16:16,100 --> 00:16:18,050
What's the use of just working hard?

362
00:16:18,050 --> 00:16:20,620
He's already spent
2 extra years in high school.

363
00:16:20,620 --> 00:16:23,320
I'm losing hope.

364
00:16:27,050 --> 00:16:29,030
It was the spring of 2004.

365
00:16:30,010 --> 00:16:32,410
The provincial mock exam results came out.

366
00:16:33,410 --> 00:16:34,510
I did terribly.

367
00:16:35,870 --> 00:16:38,270
I'd probably have to
repeat the year again.

368
00:16:39,740 --> 00:16:41,290
Around that time,

369
00:16:42,220 --> 00:16:43,390
she'd probably reached

370
00:16:43,390 --> 00:16:45,120
the end of her patience with me.

371
00:16:45,650 --> 00:16:47,530
She didn't even discuss it with me.

372
00:16:47,530 --> 00:16:49,190
She just contacted her cousin

373
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:51,800
and sent me to study
in the countryside in Xidu.

374
00:16:57,750 --> 00:16:58,850
But I think

375
00:16:59,840 --> 00:17:01,010
that was the only right decision

376
00:17:01,010 --> 00:17:02,510
she ever made in her life.

377
00:17:03,590 --> 00:17:05,920
And that was the only thing
I thank her for.

378
00:17:08,740 --> 00:17:10,050
Compared to her,

379
00:17:10,589 --> 00:17:12,420
my uncle felt more like family.

380
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:14,020
After you went to Xidu,

381
00:17:14,250 --> 00:17:16,700
did you know how Chen Chunli was doing?

382
00:17:18,089 --> 00:17:18,829
No.

383
00:17:19,770 --> 00:17:20,770
And I didn't care.

384
00:17:21,140 --> 00:17:22,400
The money for your

385
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:25,849
education, marriage,
and house over the years

386
00:17:25,869 --> 00:17:27,339
all came from Chen Chunli.

387
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:28,329
Do you know that?

388
00:17:29,760 --> 00:17:30,560
Is that so?

389
00:17:31,510 --> 00:17:32,750
What a great mom.

390
00:17:38,350 --> 00:17:39,000
Here.

391
00:17:39,530 --> 00:17:40,420
Explain this.

392
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:47,010
What is this?

393
00:17:47,290 --> 00:17:49,310
On April 17th, 2004,

394
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:51,920
Du Juan, a female teacher
at a technical school,

395
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:53,980
was murdered in the staff dormitory.

396
00:17:54,010 --> 00:17:56,710
The killers were Xin Xiaoliang,
Hu Xiaofei,

397
00:17:56,940 --> 00:17:57,770
and you.

398
00:17:57,850 --> 00:18:00,080
You originally wanted to intimidate

399
00:18:00,110 --> 00:18:01,290
Du Juan

400
00:18:01,320 --> 00:18:02,110
into telling

401
00:18:02,110 --> 00:18:04,220
the truth about the death
of Han Pinmu's mother.

402
00:18:04,220 --> 00:18:07,080
But you didn't expect her
to have a heart condition.

403
00:18:07,250 --> 00:18:08,420
After she had a heart attack,

404
00:18:08,420 --> 00:18:10,400
you stabbed her

405
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:11,270
with a triangular scraper
Hu Xiaofei brought.

406
00:18:11,270 --> 00:18:12,900
You stabbed her once.

407
00:18:12,930 --> 00:18:14,750
When you left the crime scene,

408
00:18:14,860 --> 00:18:17,260
the surveillance camera
captured this photo.

409
00:18:17,260 --> 00:18:17,910
Right?

410
00:18:23,750 --> 00:18:24,550
Officer,

411
00:18:25,330 --> 00:18:27,060
you have quite an imagination.

412
00:18:33,190 --> 00:18:35,470
Then why didn't you use that imagination

413
00:18:35,380 --> 00:18:37,530
[Abyss]

414
00:18:35,500 --> 00:18:37,600
to finish the novel, Abyss,

415
00:18:37,630 --> 00:18:39,160
instead of deleting it all?

416
00:18:41,120 --> 00:18:42,190
What a pity.

417
00:18:42,830 --> 00:18:44,760
You should've deleted it earlier.

418
00:18:53,550 --> 00:18:54,270
Speak.

419
00:18:55,880 --> 00:18:57,270
Wh-What's wrong with her?

420
00:18:57,270 --> 00:18:58,470
Why is she not moving?

421
00:18:58,880 --> 00:19:00,210
She seems to have stopped breathing.

422
00:19:00,210 --> 00:19:04,580
[Filming]

423
00:19:00,530 --> 00:19:02,010
We were just scaring her.

424
00:19:02,270 --> 00:19:03,180
What do we do?

425
00:19:03,660 --> 00:19:04,680
What are you doing?

426
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:05,640
Stop him!

427
00:19:06,700 --> 00:19:08,290
Why did you stab her?

428
00:19:13,230 --> 00:19:14,510
Everyone involved

429
00:19:14,530 --> 00:19:16,120
in this recording

430
00:19:16,190 --> 00:19:17,140
is dead,

431
00:19:17,320 --> 00:19:18,360
except you.

432
00:19:20,460 --> 00:19:21,350
Xiaofei is dead?

433
00:19:21,350 --> 00:19:22,550
Haven't you noticed?

434
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:24,030
Feiyang's account

435
00:19:24,030 --> 00:19:26,230
hasn't been logged into for a long time.

436
00:19:35,580 --> 00:19:36,510
How did he die?

437
00:19:36,850 --> 00:19:39,090
Killed by the serial killer

438
00:19:39,090 --> 00:19:40,490
you guys were imitating.

439
00:19:40,660 --> 00:19:42,010
The direct cause of his death

440
00:19:42,010 --> 00:19:43,380
was this novel.

441
00:19:50,290 --> 00:19:51,250
Tell us.

442
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:52,720
Why did

443
00:19:53,010 --> 00:19:54,090
Hu Xiaofei's company

444
00:19:54,090 --> 00:19:55,870
wire you 300,000 eight years ago?

445
00:19:55,870 --> 00:19:58,080
Did you do some work for them?

446
00:19:58,250 --> 00:19:59,880
Or did he owe you something?

447
00:20:02,330 --> 00:20:03,180
Look at me.

448
00:20:05,110 --> 00:20:06,200
Look at me!

449
00:20:08,620 --> 00:20:10,680
Don't think you can get away with this

450
00:20:11,060 --> 00:20:12,370
by staying silent.

451
00:20:13,290 --> 00:20:14,690
Let's try something new.

452
00:20:15,830 --> 00:20:17,110
Your silence now

453
00:20:17,110 --> 00:20:18,550
is meaningless.

454
00:20:19,030 --> 00:20:20,630
You probably don't know yet.

455
00:20:20,720 --> 00:20:22,160
Your son, Guo Pengfei,

456
00:20:22,180 --> 00:20:23,240
is right next door.

457
00:20:23,720 --> 00:20:25,440
If you don't talk, he will.

458
00:20:26,760 --> 00:20:28,210
You arrested him?

459
00:20:28,530 --> 00:20:29,830
On what grounds?

460
00:20:30,530 --> 00:20:31,570
I'm the victim!

461
00:20:31,570 --> 00:20:33,720
I'm the one who almost died!

462
00:20:33,740 --> 00:20:35,940
Is this how you treat a victim's family?

463
00:20:39,010 --> 00:20:39,810
Let him go!

464
00:20:40,790 --> 00:20:42,520
Guo Pengfei knows nothing.

465
00:20:42,540 --> 00:20:43,810
He's innocent!

466
00:20:43,840 --> 00:20:45,250
He's just a kid.

467
00:20:45,270 --> 00:20:46,800
Please let him go, will you?

468
00:20:49,490 --> 00:20:51,200
If you dare frame him,

469
00:20:51,610 --> 00:20:52,680
I'll die right here!

470
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:54,420
I won't let you off even as a ghost!

471
00:20:54,420 --> 00:20:57,020
It's not up to you
whether he's innocent or not!

472
00:20:57,700 --> 00:20:59,550
The evidence decides.

473
00:21:01,850 --> 00:21:04,010
Now he's telling his side,
and you tell yours.

474
00:21:04,010 --> 00:21:06,010
Talking nonsense or staying silent

475
00:21:06,010 --> 00:21:07,740
won't do your son any good.

476
00:21:09,090 --> 00:21:09,900
Understand?

477
00:21:14,750 --> 00:21:15,850
Officers,

478
00:21:17,250 --> 00:21:19,330
you barged into my company

479
00:21:19,330 --> 00:21:20,590
and brought me here for no reason.

480
00:21:20,590 --> 00:21:22,180
As a law-abiding citizen,

481
00:21:22,350 --> 00:21:24,300
I've cooperated as much as I should.

482
00:21:24,300 --> 00:21:25,880
I don't know anything about

483
00:21:25,900 --> 00:21:26,960
what you just said.

484
00:21:27,330 --> 00:21:28,790
And it has nothing to do with me.

485
00:21:28,790 --> 00:21:30,720
I think I have the right to a lawyer.

486
00:21:31,160 --> 00:21:32,150
Of course.

487
00:21:32,370 --> 00:21:33,500
You have that right.

488
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:35,550
Since you didn't even know

489
00:21:35,550 --> 00:21:36,680
Hu Xiaofei was dead,

490
00:21:36,770 --> 00:21:38,110
there's one more thing

491
00:21:38,110 --> 00:21:39,510
you probably don't know.

492
00:21:41,440 --> 00:21:42,270
Han Pinmu

493
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:44,250
has terminal liver cancer.

494
00:21:44,680 --> 00:21:46,410
He doesn't have much time left.

495
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:47,400
He...

496
00:21:58,210 --> 00:21:59,470
It doesn't matter now.

497
00:22:00,090 --> 00:22:01,660
It was 8 years ago anyway.

498
00:22:03,140 --> 00:22:05,380
Since I went to Xidu,

499
00:22:05,920 --> 00:22:07,830
we haven't been in touch much.

500
00:22:08,550 --> 00:22:10,290
Just playing games occasionally.

501
00:22:10,290 --> 00:22:11,700
Don't you want to know

502
00:22:11,880 --> 00:22:13,510
why your old buddy

503
00:22:13,530 --> 00:22:15,640
suddenly cut ties with you?

504
00:22:16,440 --> 00:22:17,700
And don't you want to know

505
00:22:17,700 --> 00:22:19,270
why your mother, Chen Chunli,

506
00:22:19,270 --> 00:22:21,630
sent you to someone else's family?

507
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:24,450
[Filming]

508
00:22:23,040 --> 00:22:25,430
As for the ending of Abyss,

509
00:22:25,750 --> 00:22:28,240
you should hear my version.

510
00:22:30,350 --> 00:22:31,240
Speak.

511
00:22:31,270 --> 00:22:32,890
Speak! Hurry up and speak!

512
00:22:33,170 --> 00:22:34,230
Hurry up!

513
00:22:34,350 --> 00:22:35,700
Come on! Speak!

514
00:22:35,720 --> 00:22:36,740
Say something!

515
00:22:36,830 --> 00:22:37,900
-Come on! Speak!
-Keep your voice down!

516
00:22:37,900 --> 00:22:39,800
Hurry up and speak!

517
00:22:40,240 --> 00:22:41,940
Speak now!

518
00:22:42,010 --> 00:22:42,880
Speak!

519
00:22:43,740 --> 00:22:44,790
Speak!

520
00:22:48,940 --> 00:22:49,660
Speak.

521
00:23:06,160 --> 00:23:07,490
Wh-What's wrong with her?

522
00:23:07,490 --> 00:23:08,690
Why is she not moving?

523
00:23:23,530 --> 00:23:25,590
She seems to have stopped breathing.

524
00:23:27,480 --> 00:23:28,950
We were just scaring her.

525
00:23:29,040 --> 00:23:30,570
Wh-What do we do now?

526
00:23:35,680 --> 00:23:36,460
What do we do?

527
00:23:49,110 --> 00:23:50,170
What are you doing?

528
00:23:51,610 --> 00:23:52,730
Stop him!

529
00:24:02,790 --> 00:24:04,270
Why did you stab her?

530
00:24:15,680 --> 00:24:16,740
Are you crazy?

531
00:24:17,890 --> 00:24:20,010
How do we get out of this?

532
00:24:20,110 --> 00:24:21,610
My dad will kill me!

533
00:24:23,010 --> 00:24:25,800
I... I know 2 murderers.

534
00:24:26,270 --> 00:24:27,850
I know how they operate.

535
00:24:30,500 --> 00:24:31,850
We can copy their methods

536
00:24:31,850 --> 00:24:33,450
to get ourselves out of this.

537
00:24:36,230 --> 00:24:37,710
Will... Will that work?

538
00:24:37,730 --> 00:24:38,930
What else could we do?

539
00:24:39,420 --> 00:24:41,350
Wait here for the cops to arrest us?

540
00:24:43,600 --> 00:24:45,430
Well... wh-what should we do?

541
00:24:53,030 --> 00:24:56,310
Th-They usually stab 3 times.

542
00:24:59,550 --> 00:25:00,810
This is the first stab.

543
00:25:02,180 --> 00:25:02,980
Two more to go.

544
00:25:05,150 --> 00:25:06,190
You guys do it.

545
00:25:07,800 --> 00:25:09,030
We have to do it too?

546
00:25:10,870 --> 00:25:11,840
I wouldn't dare.

547
00:25:12,700 --> 00:25:13,990
She's already dead!

548
00:25:14,200 --> 00:25:15,460
What are you afraid of?

549
00:25:19,850 --> 00:25:20,790
Or...

550
00:25:21,680 --> 00:25:23,370
do you want to stay clean

551
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:24,990
and report us when we get out?

552
00:25:24,990 --> 00:25:26,010
I don't!

553
00:25:27,590 --> 00:25:29,000
Then cut the crap

554
00:25:29,550 --> 00:25:30,720
and do as I said.

555
00:25:41,850 --> 00:25:42,740
Pengfei.

556
00:25:49,020 --> 00:25:50,640
Pengfei. Pengfei.

557
00:25:54,370 --> 00:25:55,070
Pengfei.

558
00:26:23,950 --> 00:26:25,010
Your turn.

559
00:27:07,470 --> 00:27:08,480
This way!

560
00:27:20,520 --> 00:27:22,880
Damn you all!

561
00:27:23,750 --> 00:27:25,980
You ruined my son!

562
00:27:26,110 --> 00:27:28,870
And you destroyed my lifelong hope!

563
00:27:30,310 --> 00:27:31,480
It was you, right

564
00:27:31,850 --> 00:27:32,900
Right?

565
00:27:32,900 --> 00:27:34,160
Did you put him up to this?

566
00:27:34,160 --> 00:27:35,000
-Was it you?
-Ms. Chen.

567
