847
00:43:37,850 --> 00:43:40,180
The victims of the 3/12 Case
had no choice.

848
00:43:40,600 --> 00:43:42,400
Bi Dehua's family had no choice.

849
00:43:43,090 --> 00:43:45,650
Xin Jiran and Officer Zhao's families
had no choice.

850
00:43:45,650 --> 00:43:46,880
How many people became sacrifices

851
00:43:46,880 --> 00:43:47,980
for your revenge?

852
00:43:47,980 --> 00:43:49,640
Stop playing the victim here.

853
00:43:51,900 --> 00:43:53,500
What if it were you?

854
00:43:55,030 --> 00:43:57,830
Seeing your mother's brains
spilled on the ground

855
00:43:58,610 --> 00:44:00,610
while her killer remains at large,

856
00:44:01,550 --> 00:44:02,730
what would you do?

857
00:44:02,910 --> 00:44:04,060
I would be furious,

858
00:44:04,230 --> 00:44:05,330
in pain,

859
00:44:05,610 --> 00:44:08,470
and want to tear that person apart
with my own hands.

860
00:44:09,280 --> 00:44:10,880
But I would never become him.

861
00:44:12,280 --> 00:44:13,780
I would put on a police uniform,

862
00:44:13,780 --> 00:44:15,380
send him to court myself,

863
00:44:15,510 --> 00:44:17,480
and let law and justice judge him!

864
00:44:18,230 --> 00:44:19,550
Just like now.

865
00:44:35,110 --> 00:44:37,290
With the approval
of the Provincial High People's Court,

866
00:44:37,290 --> 00:44:39,590
the court has verified
the facts of the case,

867
00:44:39,590 --> 00:44:41,800
examined the evidence,

868
00:44:39,750 --> 00:44:41,370
♪ Lost in the haze of memory ♪

869
00:44:42,300 --> 00:44:44,360
heard the statements
of both the prosecution and the defense,

870
00:44:44,210 --> 00:44:45,680
♪ Piercing straight through my heart ♪

871
00:44:44,360 --> 00:44:47,220
and listened
to the defendants' final statements.

872
00:44:47,260 --> 00:44:49,610
The collegial panel
has deliberated on this case.

873
00:44:48,320 --> 00:44:51,810
♪ That youthful face,
why is all that remains ♪

874
00:44:50,340 --> 00:44:52,600
In accordance with Articles 232,

875
00:44:52,670 --> 00:44:54,070
238,

876
00:44:52,760 --> 00:44:55,650
♪ Just a black cloth
and a line of infamy ♪

877
00:44:54,420 --> 00:44:55,920
and 307

878
00:44:56,170 --> 00:44:58,540
of the Criminal Law
of the People's Republic of China,

879
00:44:57,440 --> 00:44:59,000
♪ I chase after time ♪

880
00:44:58,760 --> 00:44:59,980
the judgment is as follows.

881
00:44:59,980 --> 00:45:01,170
All rise.

882
00:45:01,780 --> 00:45:02,580
[Defendant]

883
00:45:01,890 --> 00:45:03,530
♪ I hide myself away ♪

884
00:45:06,010 --> 00:45:09,620
♪ How many times have I run and fallen,
just so ♪

885
00:45:07,320 --> 00:45:09,920
First, defendant Han Pinmu

886
00:45:09,750 --> 00:45:11,530
[Defendant]

887
00:45:09,920 --> 00:45:11,420
is found guilty of intentional homicide,

888
00:45:10,480 --> 00:45:13,510
♪ The belated truth
could find a place to rest ♪

889
00:45:11,610 --> 00:45:13,900
harboring, and forging evidence.

890
00:45:14,090 --> 00:45:16,450
He is sentenced to death,

891
00:45:14,850 --> 00:45:16,540
♪ Who pretends to forget? ♪

892
00:45:16,690 --> 00:45:18,150
with a two-year reprieve,

893
00:45:18,280 --> 00:45:20,150
and deprived of political rights for life.

894
00:45:19,370 --> 00:45:21,130
♪ Who flees in panic? ♪

895
00:45:20,440 --> 00:45:24,580
Second, defendant Sun Qiang
is found guilty of intentional homicide.

896
00:45:23,810 --> 00:45:27,190
♪ Above the abyss, who is watching? ♪

897
00:45:24,690 --> 00:45:26,090
He is sentenced to death,

898
00:45:26,130 --> 00:45:27,590
with a two-year reprieve,

899
00:45:27,730 --> 00:45:29,510
and deprived of political rights for life.

900
00:45:28,450 --> 00:45:32,480
♪ Under the heavens, who can escape? ♪

901
00:45:30,340 --> 00:45:32,650
Third, defendant Guo Pengfei

902
00:45:32,650 --> 00:45:34,320
is found guilty of intentional homicide,

903
00:45:34,110 --> 00:45:43,820
♪ Rise rise rise rise rise ♪

904
00:45:34,500 --> 00:45:37,410
illegal detention, and harboring.

905
00:45:37,530 --> 00:45:38,780
He is sentenced

906
00:45:38,880 --> 00:45:41,190
to 10 years in prison.

907
00:45:43,420 --> 00:45:45,530
Fourth, defendant Chen Chunli

908
00:45:45,900 --> 00:45:48,670
is found guilty
of harboring and forging evidence.

909
00:45:48,670 --> 00:45:49,790
She is sentenced

910
00:45:49,900 --> 00:45:51,880
to 8 years in prison.

911
00:46:08,370 --> 00:46:12,420
[In Memory of Beloved Son, Bi Dehua]

912
00:46:11,920 --> 00:46:12,450
Brother,

913
00:46:13,670 --> 00:46:14,670
it's been 8 years.

914
00:46:19,190 --> 00:46:20,650
Your wrongful conviction

915
00:46:20,760 --> 00:46:22,760
has finally been overturned today.

916
00:46:23,280 --> 00:46:25,410
The state has provided compensation.

917
00:46:25,710 --> 00:46:26,510
Don't worry.

918
00:46:27,340 --> 00:46:29,340
I'll take good care of your parents.

919
00:46:52,480 --> 00:46:54,660
♪ Even if the heat burns my life ♪

920
00:46:55,440 --> 00:46:56,060
Here.

921
00:47:22,800 --> 00:47:24,400
They've all been sentenced.

922
00:47:26,280 --> 00:47:27,480
The last time

923
00:47:27,880 --> 00:47:29,530
I interrogated Guo Pengfei,

924
00:47:29,550 --> 00:47:30,660
he told me

925
00:47:32,110 --> 00:47:33,320
the final stab

926
00:47:33,570 --> 00:47:35,010
was by Hu Xiaofei.

927
00:47:36,400 --> 00:47:37,430
Xiaoliang

928
00:47:37,930 --> 00:47:39,010
didn't do it.

929
00:48:21,820 --> 00:48:23,420
Let them fly.

930
00:48:24,920 --> 00:48:26,570
They're only free when they're out.
